                <td style="padding: 15px; border: 1px solid var(--border);">Fast to Complete</td>
                <td style="padding: 15px; border: 1px solid var(--border);">Raises pH to 10.0, saponifies fatty acids, hydrolyzes sticky soils</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">
                <td style="padding: 15px; font-weight: 600; border: 1px solid var(--border);"><strong>Carrier Liquid</strong></td>
                <td style="padding: 15px; border: 1px solid var(--border);">Deionized Water (DI Water)</td>
                <td style="padding: 15px; border: 1px solid var(--border);">90.0% - 97.0%</td>
                <td style="padding: 15px; border: 1px solid var(--border);">Moderate</td>
                <td style="padding: 15px; border: 1px solid var(--border);">Bulk solvent, dissolves actives, ensures zero dissolved mineral residues</td>
